{% doc %}
  The full screen image viewer of the product page: one native <dialog>, opened by the zoom buttons that
  sections/main-product.liquid puts over each gallery image. assets/zoom.js fills it. Decision record:
  docs/decisions/014-product-image-zoom-is-a-native-dialog.md.

  It shows the image the shopper chose, at the largest size the store has, fitted to the screen (a click
  or the Zoom button shows it twice as wide, and the stage scrolls), the image's own description, and, when
  the image belongs to variants, "Shown for: Moss / M". Previous and next buttons and the arrow keys move
  through the images; Escape or the close button return to the gallery with focus on the button that opened it.

  The image's width and height attributes are only there for the markup rules: CSS sizes the image and the loaded file brings its own ratio.

  Rendered once per page, only when the setting "Let shoppers zoom product images" is on. The dialog is
  modal, so the page behind it is inert. Focus starts on the Close button (autofocus), not on the scrolling stage, so no ring is drawn around the picture on open.

  @example
  {% render 'product-zoom' %}
{% enddoc %}

<dialog class="zoom" aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}">
  <div class="zoom__stage" tabindex="0"><img alt="" width="1600" height="1600" decoding="async"></div>
  <p class="zoom__caption mono"></p>
  <button class="icon-button zoom__close" type="button" autofocus data-zoom-close aria-label="{{ 'general.close' | t }}">{%- render 'icon', name: 'close' -%}</button>
  <button class="icon-button zoom__toggle" type="button" data-zoom-toggle aria-pressed="false" aria-label="{{ 'products.zoom_toggle' | t }}">{%- render 'icon', name: 'plus' -%}</button>
  <button class="icon-button zoom__step zoom__prev" type="button" data-zoom-step="-1" aria-label="{{ 'general.previous' | t }}">{%- render 'icon', name: 'arrow-right' -%}</button>
  <button class="icon-button zoom__step zoom__next" type="button" data-zoom-step="1" aria-label="{{ 'general.next' | t }}">{%- render 'icon', name: 'arrow-right' -%}</button>
</dialog>

<script src="{{ 'zoom.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>

{% stylesheet %}
  html:has(dialog.zoom[open]) { overflow: hidden; }
  .zoom { width: 100%; height: 100%; max-width: none; max-height: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; background: var(--color-bg); color: var(--color-fg); }
  .zoom[open] { display: grid; grid-template-rows: 1fr auto; }
  .zoom__stage { display: flex; min-height: 0; overflow: auto; touch-action: pan-x pan-y pinch-zoom; }
  .zoom__stage:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: -4px; }
  .zoom__stage img { width: 100%; height: 100%; margin: auto; object-fit: contain; cursor: zoom-in; }
  .zoom[data-zoomed] .zoom__stage img { flex: none; width: 200%; height: auto; max-width: none; margin: auto; object-fit: initial; cursor: zoom-out; }
  .zoom__caption { display: grid; gap: 0.25rem; min-height: 3rem; margin: 0; padding: 0.75rem 4rem; text-align: center; font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .zoom__caption span:last-child { color: var(--color-fg); }
  .zoom__close, .zoom__toggle, .zoom__step { position: absolute; z-index: 1; background: var(--color-bg); border: 1px solid var(--color-control); }
  .zoom__close { inset-block-start: 0.75rem; inset-inline-end: 0.75rem; }
  .zoom__toggle { inset-block-start: 0.75rem; inset-inline-end: 4.25rem; }
  .zoom__toggle[aria-pressed='true'] { border-color: var(--color-fg); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--color-fg); }
  .zoom[data-zoomed] .zoom__toggle .icon { transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .zoom__step { inset-block-start: 50%; translate: 0 -50%; }
  .zoom__prev { inset-inline-start: 0.75rem; }
  .zoom__next { inset-inline-end: 0.75rem; }
  .zoom__prev .icon { transform: scaleX(-1); }
  [dir='rtl'] .zoom__prev .icon { transform: none; }
  .zoom[data-single] .zoom__step { display: none; }
  .zoom[data-zoomed] .zoom__step { display: none; }
{% endstylesheet %}
